    "extract": "Iron Storm, originally released in Japan as World Advanced Daisenryaku: Koutetsu no Senpuu, is a 1995 turn-based strategy video game for the Sega Saturn. It was released in 1996 in North America. It is part of the Daisenryaku series which was developed and published by Sega.",
    "extract_html": "<p><i><b>Iron Storm</b></i>, originally released in Japan as <i><b>World Advanced Daisenryaku: Koutetsu no Senpuu</b></i>, is a 1995 turn-based strategy video game for the Sega Saturn. It was released in 1996 in North America. It is part of the <i>Daisenryaku</i> series which was developed and published by Sega.</p>"
